  "narrative": {
    "intro": "General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre has $532M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date, spread across 27 awards with an average award size of $19.7M. Obligations fell 9.2% year over year. Annual obligations have varied by fiscal year: FY21 was $229M, FY22 was $216M, FY23 was $833M, FY24 was $595M, FY25 was $586M, and FY26 is $532M to date. Ammunition (except Small Arms) Manufacturing is the largest market for General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre in FY2026 to date, with $389M in obligations. Facilities Support Services is the second market, with $143M in obligations. The page reports that current-year totals are partial, so FY2026 totals represent fiscal year to date obligations rather than a full year total. The dataset lists obligations as contract obligations except where award-value figures are explicitly noted as total contract values in other tables.",
    "sections": [
