        "heading": "How has General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre’s federal business changed year over year?",
        "body": "General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre obligated $532M in FY2026 to date, down 9.2% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations peaked at $833M in FY23 and have since declined to $595M in FY24, $586M in FY25, and $532M in FY26 to date. The company’s award count for FY2026 to date is 27, with an average award size of $19.7M."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What are General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre’s main markets and contract types?",
        "body": "Ammunition (except Small Arms) Manufacturing is the largest market for General Dynamics Ots Wilkes Barre in FY2026 to date, accounting for $389M in obligations. Facilities Support Services is the next largest, with $143M in obligations. The reported figures are contract obligations and reflect fiscal year to date totals for FY2026."
      }
